Body:
I accidentally opened a duplicate issue for this. A possible workaround: override the model's limit in `~/.config/opencode/opencode.json`:

```json
{
  "provider": {
    "amazon-bedrock": {
      "models": {
        "us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-6-v1": {
          "limit": {
            "context": 200000,
            "output": 32000
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

With this, the "% used" in OpenCode's sidebar appears to be correct for 200K tokens.

